// - date: when it happened / was reported
// - headline: the original article's headline
// - source: publication name (add author name too if the article bylines one)
// - url: link to the original article — always attribute out
// - take: one sentence of your own analysis/context. This is what makes
//   the page yours, not just a copy of your News page.

